	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. legi (pater in Christo reverende) literas d. d. <persName ref="p1283">Gesneri</persName> ex iisque <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>intellexi paucula quaedam de motibus <placeName ref="l832">Gallicis</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Utinam d. d. <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>scribendo fuisset prolixior.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Communicavi et d. legato; <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sed is (ut solent) extenuat nonnihil et affirmat motus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>compositos, quod ego tamen non credo.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quare, si vos, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>reverende pater, habueritis aliquid certi, nos nolite celare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Scio ego tuas occupationes, praesertim nunc; sed poteris <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>hoc negocium scribendi aliis dare.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Legi etiam literas tuas <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad d. <persName>Philippum</persName> collegam; sed mirari satis non potui te addidisse <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quaedam de coronato coniugi meae reddendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Qui tibi hoc <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>venit in mentem cogitare, quasi vere tibi tuisque non omnia mea <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>debeam, et quam humanitatem exteris nihilque de me meritis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>fueram exhibiturus, cur eandem non tuis quoque exhiberem?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Quare, si me amas, noli committere, ut posthac tale aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ex te audiam; ego certe iniuria me affici existimarem, si <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>pecunias pro officiis multis nominibus tibi debitis mihi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>offerres.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Hoc esset exprobrare officium, non boni consulere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Ego existimo bonorum amicorum esse non tam exacte officia <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ad calculum revocare.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">D. <persName>Philippum</persName>, quod eam curam ad se recepisset, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>existimabam iam diu scripsisse; equus bene convaluit; <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>is solvet.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Ir werdend ein bösen bezaler gnuͦg an im han; <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>er ist ein <placeName ref="l638">Engadiner</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Haec per iocum; d. enim <persName>Philippum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>amo et me ab eo amari animadverto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Nunc ad <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>domestica:</foreign> Der rächtshandel ist angefangen; der ander <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>rächtstag ist gesetzt uff den nächsten donstag nach Geörgi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Fratres obtulerunt sororem ad tormenta et in eo fuerunt, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ut <persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> quoque comprehenderetur; sed id obtinere nondum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>potuerunt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Utrinque interceditur a multis; sed deus <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>hanc causam urget.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Quis enim credidisset unquam cessantibus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>omnibus fratres ipsos rem aggressuros et propriam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>sororem carnifici exposituros?</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName>Tres Pagi</placeName> scripserunt ad <foreign xml:lang="de">landrichter</foreign> <placeName>Superioris Foederis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ut det operam, quo noster <persName ref="p293">Beccaria</persName> Mysauco pellatur.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Scripsit <foreign xml:lang="de">landtrichter</foreign> cum suis Mysaucensibus; urget negocium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/><placeName>Mysaucenses</placeName> provocant ad reliqua duo Foedera.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Sy mögend, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>gott lob, die sach nienen hin bringen, und söltend sy etc.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> calendis aprilis anno 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvum te cupiunt nostri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvere ex nobis iubebis <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>tuos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Tuus observantissimus <persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro eruditione et pietate exce<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>llenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Ti<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>gurinae</placeName> antistiti vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>domino et patrono suo multum ob<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>serv<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ando.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
